634	     * The effective registration date to store for a new owner: the date supplied on the request
635	     * when present, otherwise the current server date, in either case rolled forward to a business
636	     * day so it never falls on a weekend or public holiday (rolled forward to the next such day).
637	     * This single point of resolution is what every registration-date-derived value (the stored
638	     * date, the membership number's year segment, the per-day create-limit) is computed from.
639	     */
640	    private static LocalDate resolveRegistrationDate(LocalDate suppliedDate) {
641	        LocalDate date = suppliedDate != null ? suppliedDate : LocalDate.now();
642	        return toBusinessDay(date);
