862	     * The membership level ceiling for a newly registered {@code owner}, derived from the household it
863	     * joins: one above the current maximum {@link Owner#getMembershipLevel() membershipLevel} among the
864	     * existing housemates (owners sharing the same {@code householdId}), so a new owner's reported level
865	     * can never exceed one above the household's current best. Returns {@code null} - meaning no ceiling
866	     * applies - when the owner has no existing household member.
